{"4233310": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Where Time Ends", "steam_appid": 4233310, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A psychological journey of mystery and puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a time machine to see your deceased mother one last time. Driven by grief</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and obsession, the protagonist clings to the only hope left: defy the laws of spacetime</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >to reclaim a lost moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4233310/extras/ed35f95032f2db4bdf5ac992c8f96b18.poster.avif?t=1788289435\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4233310/extras/ed35f95032f2db4bdf5ac992c8f96b18.webm?t=1788289435\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4233310/extras/ed35f95032f2db4bdf5ac992c8f96b18.mp4?t=1788289435\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Building the Time Machine</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape the machine step by step, from welding its walls to creating a core capable</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >of manipulating time. Face a series of varied puzzles that will test your logic and</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >determination as you get closer to the heart of your goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4233310/extras/090a54078b0cc26ec8a50cac2337c67f.poster.avif?t=1788289435\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4233310/extras/090a54078b0cc26ec8a50cac2337c67f.webm?t=1788289435\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock All Nine Endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover 9 unique endings that explore different ways of coping with grief. Each</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >one has its own tone, ranging from dark and symbolic to surreal and dreamlike,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >revealing varied interpretations of pain, obsession, and loss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4233310/extras/3c5794ba356b6ffa4a5ef20f985a34b7.poster.avif?t=1788289435\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4233310/extras/3c5794ba356b6ffa4a5ef20f985a34b7.webm?t=1788289435\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4233310/extras/3c5794ba356b6ffa4a5ef20f985a34b7.mp4?t=1788289435\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An Introspective Journey</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience an emotional journey through grief, the fear of facing reality, and the</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >consequences of clinging to the past in a world where logic breaks down and time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >no longer behaves as it should.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A psychological journey of mystery and puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a time machine to see your deceased mother one last time. Driven by grief</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and obsession, the protagonist clings to the only hope left: defy the laws of spacetime</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >to reclaim a lost moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_a